{
  "id": 2079,
  "name": "pink-tablecloth",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "落ち着いた　ピンクカラーの　テーブルクロス。肌に優しい　サラリとした　さわり心地で食器を　置いても　音を　立てない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "차분한 핑크 컬러의 테이블보. 피부에 자극이 적은 매끈한 재질이며 식기를 올려놓아도 소리가 나지 않는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以沉穩的粉紅色為質地的桌巾。觸感輕柔，如同撫過肌膚一般，而且放置餐具時也不會發出聲響。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une nappe d’une douce couleur rose. Sa texture satinée est agréable au toucher et étouffe le bruit des plats lorsqu’on les pose dessus.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses schlichte pinke Tischtuch aus hautfreundlichem, glattem Material absorbiert jegliches Geräusch von Geschirr, das darauf platziert wird.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un mantel de un suave color rosa. Está hecho de un material tan sedoso y delicado que hasta absorbe el sonido que producen los platos al colocarlos sobre él.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tovaglia di un sobrio color rosa. È così liscia e morbida al tatto che quando ci poggi le stoviglie non fanno rumore.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A simple pink tablecloth. It’s smooth and pleasant to the touch, and dishes can be placed on it with hardly a sound.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "落ち着いた　ピンクカラーの　テーブルクロス。肌に優しい　サラリとした　さわり心地で食器を　置いても　音を　立てない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "稳重的粉红色桌巾。丝柔顺滑亲近肌肤，放上餐具也不会发出声音。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
